// M5-A3P-1003. Ch18 §4 Oruvel (offered). New hulls lashed to the old keel-hull; a rebuild begun.
// Tavi has come to help (if ch07_told_tavi). Kell's stall is an empty frame on the second mooring; RHEN DOESN'T TOUCH
// THE WICK (§10 Q3: Kell is not seen in Act III; the wick stays in his tin until E7).
title: ch18_revisit_oruvel
location: ch01/oruvel
---
@camera K18
@mark rhen kell_stall walk
@wait 3.0
<<if $ch07_told_tavi>>
    @mark tavi kell_stall_b walk
    Tavi [neutral]: Gran's frame. I kept it standing. Didn't know what else to do with it. #line:ch18_oruvel_001
    Rhen [tender]: That's the right thing to do with it. #line:ch18_oruvel_002
    Tavi [soft_smile]: We're lashing three new hulls on. You could dive the old keel for us. #line:ch18_oruvel_003
    Rhen [soft_smile]: After. #line:ch18_oruvel_004
<<else>>
    Townsfolk as "Hull-wright" [neutral]: New hulls on the old keel. Slow, but she floats. #line:ch18_oruvel_005
<<endif>>
@anim rhen hand_on stall_frame
@wait 3.0
===
